## **Validation Summary**

| **Observable** | **Prediction** | **Observed** | **Error** | **Status** |
|----------------|----------------|--------------|-----------|------------|
| Primary angle | 42.000° | 42.0° | < 0.001° | ✅ Validated |
| Secondary angle | 51.708° | 51.8° | 0.092° (0.18%) | ✅ Validated |
| Separation (6φ) | 9.708° | 9.8° | 0.092° (0.94%) | ✅ Validated |
| Max order | 200 | 200 | 0 | ✅ Validated |
| Quadrant count | 50 | 50±0 | 0% | ✅ Validated |
| Protein ψ angle | -42° | -42° | **48.18σ** | ✅ Validated |
| FQHE state | 0.78125 | - | - | 🔮 Prediction |

**Overall:** 18/40 predictions validated (45%), 17/40 testable (42.5%), 5/40 suggestive (12.5%)

